  "body": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#font-relative\n\n> The following properties defined in this specification are [font-affecting properties](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#font-affecting-property):\n> - All longhands of the [font](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font) shorthand\n> - All longhands of the [font-synthesis](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font-synthesis) shorthand\n> - All longhands of the [font-variant](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font-variant) shorthand\n> - [font-language-override](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font-language-override)\n> - [font-feature-settings](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font-feature-settings)\n> - [font-variation-settings](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font-variation-settings)\n> - [font-optical-sizing](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font-optical-sizing)\n\nProblems:\n - `line-height` is a longhand of `font`, should it be excluded?\n - `font-palette` is not a `font` longhand, but should maybe be included? It matches the `font-*` pattern, though seems to only affect color and not metrics, so maybe not needed after all, unless color is considered a metric.\n - The `font-variant` longhands are already longhands of `font`, so they are duplicated\n - `font-language-override`, `font-feature-settings`, `font-variation-settings` and `font-optical-sizing` are already ([reset-only](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade-5/#reset-only-sub-property)) longhands of `font`, so they are duplicated",
